{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261103/photo/bkn-20261103122434975-1103_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261103142554\"/><p>地上遺下血漬。(吳鎮興攝)</p><p>荃灣發生高空墮物傷人案。今晨(3日)11時56分，一名女子途經荃灣石圍角邨石荷樓對開，被高處墮下一支長約5至6米的樹椏擊中頭部。救援人員接報趕至現場，事主陷入昏迷，由救護車送院救治。其後，消防架起升降台鋸斷有危險樹椏，警員正就事件展開調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T06:42:37.789025+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:24:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T06:39:11.546952+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:39:11.546952+00:00","content_hash":"9d6fc2d615f013726994cd24eeb0d46fedcb2ed47ac1007ec2f06f08d3486eb4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}